  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row33Member">㈱三井住友フィナンシャルグループ</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row33Member">主要金融機関として、取引の円滑化を図るために保有しております。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row33Member">有</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">（注）１．定量的な保有効果の記載は困難でありますが、「a．保有方針及び保有の合理性を検証する方法並びに個別銘柄の保有の適否に関する取締役会等における検証の内容」に記載の方法で保有の適否を個別銘柄ごとに検証しております。</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">２．保有先企業は当社の株式を保有しておりませんが、同社子会社が当社の株式を保有しております。</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
